  "bodyHash": "696234f64e1d99f9",
  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;line-height:36px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Discord&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fFusseel\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Twitter&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=x&logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=YouTube&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=youtube&logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=GitHub&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=github&logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\"></a>&emsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFuzs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=ECEBE6&labelColor=2F4858&style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">拾取通知器</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 會記錄您收集的所有物品，並以簡潔的螢幕列表顯示，讓您輕鬆掌握在採礦、探索、耕作或與怪物戰鬥時撿取了什麼。✨</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">物品、經驗值與回收的箭矢會以精簡的通知形式呈現，並隨著資源的獲得即時更新。項目會在短暫時間後平滑淡出，且能自動合併相似的拾取紀錄，保持畫面整潔。📦</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">通知列表的外觀與行為高度可自訂，您可以調整其位置、縮放比例、樣式、動畫、顯示時間等更多設定。🎛️</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">📦 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">追蹤每次拾取：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 在便利的螢幕列表中查看已收集的物品、經驗值與回收箭矢。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔄 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">智能紀錄更新：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 相似的拾取紀錄會自動合併，收集到相同物品時也會即時更新現有紀錄。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">流暢動畫：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 通知會自然淡出並滑出螢幕，而非突然消失。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🔢 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">詳細資訊：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可選顯示拾取數量、物品名稱、背包總計與物品圖示。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🎨 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">完整顯示自訂：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 可調整螢幕位置、縮放、色彩、背景、間距等設定。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏱️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">行為設定：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 控制紀錄的顯示時間、最大顯示數量以及分組方式。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌐 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">僅需安裝於客戶端：</span></strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 支援單人遊戲、模組伺服器，甚至原版伺服器皆可使用，無需額外安裝。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">客戶端必須安裝，伺服器為選填</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC &amp; NEOFORGE）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">需要安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">（FABRIC）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版需安裝 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\">，由 </span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fProspector\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 開發）。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案均位於 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 資料夾中，檔名依設定類型分別為 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 或 </span><code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size:14px\">。並非每個模組都會包含所有類型的設定檔。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">感謝 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/teamcofh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">TeamCoFH</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 提供此模組的原始概念，該靈感源自他們在 Minecraft 1.6 時代的 </span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cofh-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">CoFH Core</span></a><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 模組早期版本！</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<table style=\"text-align:center\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-tridents\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/bettertridents/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stoneworks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/stoneworks/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-anvils\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyanvils/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/let-me-sleep\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/letmesleep/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sea-life\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/sealife/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/betteranimationscollection/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-walls\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/diagonalwalls/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nether-chested\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/netherchested/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoology\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-shulker-boxes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\"></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252flunapixel.studio%252fdiscord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/pickupnotifier/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\"></p>",
